  "architecture_decision": "simple_crm.platform owns the server-rendered workspace and navigation presentation, but it reads only through scope-aware workspace queries. CRM-007 and CRM-008 remain the sole write boundaries for leads, interactions, and tasks. Today cards use explicit urgency classifications and the lead detail page composes party, lead, activity, stage, assignment, and next-task data without exposing database terminology or raw IDs.",
